        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "2. Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that the petitioner is the purchaser of the land by virtue of registered sale deeds dated 18.09.1997 and 26.07.2010.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 918,
      "end": 1081,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "18.09.1997",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1055,
          "end": 1065
        },
        {
          "text": "26.07.2010",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1070,
          "end": 1080
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13464218378067017
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "Counsel further submits that he wants amount of compensation in his favour.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1082,
      "end": 1157,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06694608181715012
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "Counsel further submits that the State has filed counter affidavit in the year 2016 in which in paragraph-6 of the counter affidavit the stand has been taken by the State is that estimate for determining compensation to the land owners in the light of the suitable provision of Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition,\nRehabilitation & Resettlement Act, 2013 has been prepared and award shall be made as and when the sanctioned of the competent authority is Patna High Court CWJC No.15119 of 2015(4)\ndt.18-09-2023 received.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1158,
      "end": 1705,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition,\nRehabilitation & Resettlement Act, 2013",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1436,
          "end": 1540
        },
        {
          "text": "Patna High Court",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 1640,
          "end": 1656
        },
        {
          "text": "CWJC No.15119 of 2015(4)",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1657,
          "end": 1681
        },
        {
          "text": "dt.18-09-2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1682,
          "end": 1695
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12031659483909607
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "In paragraph-9 of the counter affidavit also the stand of the State is that the estimate for determining compensation of the amount in the light of the suitable provision of Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation & Resettlement Act,\n2013 and award shall be made as and when the sanction of competent authority is received.\n3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1706,
      "end": 2072,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation & Resettlement Act,\n2013",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1880,
          "end": 1984
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19689635932445526
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "Learned counsel for BIADA submits that from the content of the writ petition, it transpires that Smt. Malti Devi vs The State Of Bihar And Ors on 18 September, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/60882539/\n1 the land has been purchased by the petitioner in the year 1997 and 2010 particularly on 18.09.1997 and 26.07.2010.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2073,
      "end": 2408,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "BIADA",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2093,
          "end": 2098
        },
        {
          "text": "Smt. Malti Devi vs The State Of Bihar And Ors",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 2170,
          "end": 2215
        },
        {
