      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20678049325942993
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "In this background, counsel for the State is directed to file a fresh counter affidavit ascertaining that within what period the State shall pay the amount of compensation to the petitioner, if not already paid, as assured to this Court by way of filing counter affidavit and pleading made paragraph-6 and 9 of the said counter.",
